      "hash": "b5658fc8edda24f9c94eabac9e536e0a18e3055a8ca255f9d1b8f256ea02a6cc"
    },
    {
      "id": "22a8e5c8a46308bd3909538ab5d23cd6e6b7c9417e23b7dab4c7fd2b290d4b4e",
      "text": "The Code",
      "hash": "1b58f287e49b8480bc95dc0d05e5d9278f0fc06eb88b600e3ea36191c92eb1da"
    },
    {
      "id": "c5db3c30d40062c0dc6c52c25499ddd290a7095634ff22c6ee522040f414a07a",
      "text": "The Prompt",
      "hash": "038956745e11c5db795719153cdafdc238517adb74eeeda50004c79268b6ce92"
    },
    {
      "id": "b01632ef9a00f7ea631046792ea940bdcbb7da8a28ff4daa85a794d3a18062a4",
      "text": "The Demo",
      "hash": "7181958489d63c40afdfc61f31c774fd645289f88d402f6c2d6e7113476ae259"
    },
    {
      "id": "9c3222aa692248874d063dfe146e94f4dcaf419c5dcc304659bda876c6c07b60",
      "text": "Conclusion",
      "hash": "89db2ad881f29c18b305a20c8ed7bdffdfde49d633c27a83bd204bf9cfedaba3"
    },
    {
      "id": "0abee383c8774d3b17b96f13770c79daa3ff124509bf6a5eec735109de142640",
      "text": "Up next",
      "hash": "e31da5b25f8b7324861e9aadaf5c503e7fd43e739fa3be17ebe63e999fb13df1"
    },
    {
      "id": "ee66222b4aabbf87a0b13faaab282c6b600295d44b5850460afe07ac1fb8d57d",
      "text": "We've discussed so far how to add tools to your MCP server.",
      "hash": "5cdd440918e197d7151cecd501837bf17a08e4654391f04d70fc46a58a1bc0c9"
    },
    {
      "id": "01f9f9462a6b7290da90383ad658418d539babdc97994584a3c324834af38587",
      "text": "But something I haven't seen discussed a lot online is the fact you can use an MCP server to provide prompts to users.",
      "hash": "029c3712c078c5f10c97530c67eb8faf47b8c20dcf27feda3c5d0f78f104748a"
    },
    {
      "id": "f5b63e0121b470868056b956b4d8800b3058fa6e17ff0df2f19534216cbd4160",
      "text": "This lets you use MCP as",
      "hash": "1414c6433e23237e76def4d2e5e4e63f4ad2ba608742d1d2289cae7960a36da2"
    },
    {
      "id": "4a5b5d8ab55898bea0cf2bf505984d11f7f6e2ffc75bae27a9436edae8dfdbc4",
      "text": "a prompt directory",
      "hash": "b562040aed6d0f6213245af9f416094c3898d1381605f571c7c8a6d0d4c9d3d9"
    },
    {
      "id": "c5473bc497550dd06ac2e9902ed804e9f4fa8e53b956c0f3a428a8b15d3bb785",
      "text": "- a collection of prompts that users can pull in to achieve their goals quickly.",
      "hash": "46091ec9636d605d026004b299f1846fb2f9b107736ec66ac78cc3467dd65d81"
    },
    {
      "id": "361c9a2a470f9efa2b3ff6dc5c25aca17d460d6c7004822029024709697d0de1",
      "text": "I'm going to show you",
      "hash": "5fea1dd9b71ba16067b96993430e3244d233f104e968f0892219f8b4d9277d29"
    },
    {
      "id": "ebaeba38b01eec9d52ecb790f13a394bae7ed864774cc3428e04718e2d0f2719",
      "text": "one of my favorite prompt templates",
      "hash": "a0e95bd2e79670063c3d6acd54445f86f921964e6e50764811e3ac3cd6d06a28"
    },
    {
      "id": "487f5631f97ecb3af8e66578723fba1107c466bcd571421ddb09d96cf003f052",
      "text": "that I used in the creation of this article.",
      "hash": "aa103399437d2743715468c593d768328d1e57a0a1424f9067ed5838ea55a8cf"
    },
    {
      "id": "ceadbe7c5bd6b0ca9a47c6c492baf8e094378c844fb29656bc800666ae746c55",
      "text": "Let's start with our boilerplate code: the server and the transport:",
      "hash": "869c21628392da2afc89ed5577102b34a21d002da1ab1fbf444a5cf2d8b1594d"
    },
    {
      "id": "0dd040ef119981f88e01ea712b64e08b29adfbe319069a2c37d67b3459dfe8b9",
      "text": "This server is going to house a",
      "hash": "982d786d524833281c5dff1ec0d594f3eb31b5feac4ff0ac2c9d60816d93b913"
    },
    {
      "id": "d36d9068ae711cfff76f425ec42afcd34438a0f6ec32c9f532a68e903923c930",
      "text": "prompt. I record most of my articles via dictation, and this prompt helps me clean up mistakes in the transcription.",
      "hash": "4d0558ca3e93c446408731c8448bc9099a704fbfd0927fee6ae0fdcb3d9e8690"
    },
    {
      "id": "5d08897048b24cf31ae9ebded42a5e925edd22adce67120d4512c395af6ad41b",
      "text": "Scrollycoding",
      "hash": "a92db14e4d481e7975b3459710fbf8ec73dcc232e366b057507f7e2891b1d6da"
    },
    {
      "id": "a0dd58df007b5381c6ea3e68f6bb188bf29039cd477b2ebd699dca6e4fc47e29",
      "text": "Let's start by adding a",
      "hash": "b3ea6466256c203baf88f8e2136aec6dbe20a52a48b8b7559d10cd6a68ba3c60"
    },
    {
      "id": "adf9509c33cd13263501ffbb19cffbf9ebd15da4a8c44f2901ae93b5e32fb8b7",
      "text": "to the server. This has a very similar syntax to",
      "hash": "1945c9d42d13b61fa0bcc9e398bb6d8351a99514ea51cef5577b5cde7d6ea634"
    },
    {
      "id": "3f7b3fddecf8cf8cb97add40a3d77a3ad27ab7aefc6d02979bbcdf0a2dbe97ea",
      "text": ". But instead of",
      "hash": "9703ae7fe0f17cf424d1c1c04ed80bb01302137e8cd2abbc2d46223e3147eb7c"
    },
    {
      "id": "943e27aa285daa67ff08cd022825037ec167301a07d2c426a11b92e840b2aa2c",
      "text": ", we'll call",
      "hash": "8415acfd15e9b7fac2a46dec4ca5c4dab10272110bc1e5e9fd703982a9bcbcb6"
    },
    {
      "id": "55ee0e7185c26cc88de0232fd197bff221ab2b077224e4a1b25864aa3c0c68a4",
      "text": "Next we'll add a description to describe what the tool actually does.",
      "hash": "b48c8166b7641607c53ad78fb5578f9e24365ddba785a7340131b539c66f78e1"
    },
    {
      "id": "12910031a2d9afeed735d2d6fd9d6005bcab734035c9c88fe5c5272909994e69",
      "text": "This tool is going to take in the path to the file to clean up. So let's specify that using zod:",
      "hash": "5b9308027a22ab6fff274cd5c30e01657941010be490b6b6a0d47d564ce717b3"
    },
    {
      "id": "247e8c701ef24b0ceb6401eeb26b808e654108089d1c529964ec0390d09dd937",
      "text": "Finally, we'll add a callback to return the value of the prompt. This comes back in a messages array, with a role of",
      "hash": "41937f6040b2fa0b702e927da5a5c757853a9c5ebd594344935d7ca75742a3cc"
    },
    {
      "id": "91927d0e94c6a0f4f2dad19d7aab238e4d3122d6bf254263bd9e7e355a0bdbdd",
      "text": "and some text content.",
      "hash": "3135c1e5bdb20ffb0fce41a5d45e05b65ee29efded9deb6d4f8d22fbd36f725a"
    },
    {
      "id": "732596f4a750bfdbc46f83291026777457cb092f919d8d526e74b7ffafc30d63",
      "text": "This means we've added a prompt template called clean transcription to our MCP server.",
      "hash": "a82dd1e356bfa87d4741bce69138f2539e72e774eabc987f885a7589850ec6bb"
    },
    {
      "id": "409d1c79ed3af434977867b61c23b57c121ab02935f853bbb658c0124f35ee82",
      "text": "Go deeper:",
      "hash": "15ad3d88c6733d9b257c322d3afecc9bce2b18558171007db87598c118ca17f9"
    },
    {
      "id": "826bfafbc4cfa30b5bf1510fddefe38e4017945233ec6797c451018b89e3cb03",
      "text": "join the waitlist for AI Coding for Real Engineers",
      "hash": "16c3492a8464a0859c944e287a9d433e9a2635f22a6bd8aad59f88c3e80ab732"
    },
    {
      "id": "57c58864e39fd09a1f7b0adce0a9d205714d091ae8636448c07eb0a58a1ffdfd",
      "text": "For those interested, here is the prompt I use:",
      "hash": "0b89d7abcc39f928fce62c1e18d38a61516445ae6277512f3b859227003170a3"
    },
    {
      "id": "76b3cf352bd823e37a38845e7bad62a0b46481d73d393b24e36f04ee4d1eccfc",
      "text": "There are around two hundred common terms, so I've left them off for brevity.",
      "hash": "e304dceab4e8c80fdb0311a243694eefcfcb7777479de5f8c5484058fea99ab9"
    },
    {
      "id": "3ac50b9ccdc0224aa1c7d442158c0d77f26fe9f75dc5cdf058be5ef503263a8d",
      "text": "We can connect to this server from Claude Code using the same technique as",
      "hash": "b02e54f296c2818e8b9fc977c6d0e9af0edd1491b10c83fc86922f365cfcc041"
    },
    {
      "id": "9d2d5090177e958347a1143f347ceeff920e751d345e1dbd18ad62f50c5947d7",
      "text": "we saw before",
      "hash": "c21a43870f6e0fcebdb5abe71e418817fd2f7a030115de3813c24a24c0e1f5f8"
    },
    {
      "id": "090bfd0481acc9cc3173ac89f93b99e35057bb059f7d23f9cc0c7acaf75daf37",
      "text": "When we do, the prompt template is sourced as a command we can run from within Claude. We can access it by typing",
      "hash": "4e2d68c65237b1960fa018291087de6677a4f9831dd1e8834aa21740ebde550c"
    },
    {
      "id": "b11beb2015fb13daa27b5c4637914d277c66107a2fa46bfaef1df8d232c238c2",
      "text": "within the Claude Code interface. It shows the prompt via autocomplete:",
      "hash": "5f59127978e73f878334852d5be552205e097e6d92a189488ce22cf910967f9e"
    },
    {
      "id": "79537540579833eafb1d8709174fdc737b9214f86c9d6dade4ea33de4c7d192a",
      "text": "When we run it, we are prompted to add the",
      "hash": "0252e09c33a221c1660366b108956e8d3eebbcacdaad51571b2e94aa8c7209dd"
    },
    {
      "id": "d30a975aa59df49598874211204f69c60c5408369761a0248dc726e487959c6a",
      "text": "argument:",
      "hash": "7704f77f89a971997c5968d928f8a2721e23e5bd2fafbe3f0362fe5ad6ee0624"
    },
    {
      "id": "ea5beb795527bfbc336656bd30f5741c815b641a9de970cd164ab243f4ef88f9",
      "text": "And it runs the prompt on the file.",
      "hash": "c52f7386a2c4eb1c5586501afb59e7365666be5fd57a1f281e86b7d4af5e5122"
    },
    {
